.TH tkudialog n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkudialog \- dialogs with copyable message text
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkudialog
.br
::tkutils::tkudialog::showInfo message
.SH DESCRIPTION
Modal dialogs whose message text is selectable and copyable, with a generic
builder (build/show) and ready-made variants (showInfo, showWarning, showError,
confirm, input). See docs/tkudialog.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tclutils(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, dialog, clipboard
